WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.206
Ilimin Sinadaran da ke Cikin Kayan Ruwa. Wannan shi ne babi na 1 na kwas ɗin.

2
00:00:08.653 --> 00:00:18.802
Abubuwa uku tukuna: wane surfactant ke yin wane aiki, yadda pH ke aiki, da yadda za ki hana ƙwayoyin cuta shiga.

3
00:00:19.802 --> 00:00:28.332
Dubi wannan bokitin. Muna juya surfactant, wato sinadarin da ke yin kumfa yana wanke datti, cikin ruwa, a hankali.

4
00:00:28.811 --> 00:00:34.427
Kowace ƙwayar surfactant tana da kai mai son ruwa da wutsiya mai son mai.

5
00:00:34.861 --> 00:00:47.034
Wutsiyoyin suna taruwa su zama ƙananan ƙwallaye da ake kira micelles. Maiko yana shiga ciki, kuma ruwan kurkurawa yana ɗauke shi.

6
00:00:48.034 --> 00:00:52.427
A wannan shiryayye an raba su bisa cajin da ke kansu.

7
00:00:52.906 --> 00:01:10.561
Anionic kamar SLES suna wankewa suna yin kumfa. CAPB yana sa su yi laushi. Nonionic suna yanke maiko. Cationic suna kashe ƙwayoyin cuta, suna gyara gashi, suna kuma sa kaya laushi.

8
00:01:11.561 --> 00:01:18.261
Wannan ruwa mai kama da madara shi ne mai laushin kaya, wato softener, kayan cationic ne.

9
00:01:18.647 --> 00:01:30.867
Surfactant na anionic da na cationic suna jan juna, su daskare su zama abu mai ɗanko wanda ba ya yin ko ɗaya daga cikin ayyukan.

10
00:01:31.233 --> 00:01:37.979
Shi ya sa ake saka softener a ruwan kurkurawa, ba tare da sabulun wanki ba.

11
00:01:38.979 --> 00:01:54.791
Ki kalli ma'aunin yayin da muke ɗebo kwaɓin SLES. Yawanci kusan 70% ne mai aiki, don haka giram 100 yana ɗauke da kusan giram 70 na surfactant na gaske.

12
00:01:55.132 --> 00:02:08.332
CAPB yawanci kusan 30% ne mai aiki. Kullum ki karanta takardar bayanin mai sayar miki, saboda adadin yana canzawa.

13
00:02:09.332 --> 00:02:16.795
Ga lissafin Bisi. Sinadari mai aiki shi ne kashin da kika yi amfani da shi sau ƙarfinsa, a haɗa duka.

14
00:02:17.259 --> 00:02:28.616
Tsarinta 12.3% ne mai aiki, giram 615 na surfactant na gaske a kilogiram 5.

15
00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:47.484
Lokacin da sabon SLES ɗinta ya zama 60% kawai mai aiki, ta yi amfani da giram 875 maimakon giram 750 don ƙarfin ya zama ɗaya.

16
00:02:48.484 --> 00:03:06.531
Wannan takarda tana karanta pH, wato ƙarfin tsami ko kaifi, daga 0 zuwa 14. Ruwa 7 ne. Ƙasa da shi tsami ne, sama da shi kaifi ne, kuma kowane mataki ya fi na baya ƙarfi sau goma.

17
00:03:06.948 --> 00:03:15.669
Ki tsoma, ki jira lokacin da ke kan fakitin, ki kwatanta launin a hasken rana. Ki yi gwaji kafin ki zuba launi.

18
00:03:16.669 --> 00:03:24.158
Kafin ki haɗa kowane ruwan daidaitawa, ki saka safar hannu da gilashin kariya.

19
00:03:24.545 --> 00:03:39.655
Ki zuba asid ko kostik a hankali cikin ruwa, kada ki taɓa zuba ruwa a kan sinadarin, saboda zai iya yin zafi ya fantsama. Ki rubuta suna a kowace kwalbar daidaitawa.

20
00:03:40.655 --> 00:03:57.447
Amaka ta auna samfurin giram 200, wato 1% na haɗinta, ta zuba ruwan citric acid ɗigo-ɗigo har ya nuna pH 6. Hakan ya ɗauki giram 0.9.

21
00:03:57.859 --> 00:04:08.337
Sau 100 ya ba da giram 90. Ta zuba giram 72 tukuna, ta gwada, sannan sauran a hankali, don kada ta wuce iyaka.

22
00:04:09.337 --> 00:04:17.781
Idan kina gwada kaya a gida, ki raba maganin wanke ban ɗaki da bilicin, kamar waɗannan kwalabe biyu.

23
00:04:18.781 --> 00:04:31.864
Sabulun ruwa galibi ruwa ne, kuma ruwa yana ciyar da ƙwayoyin cuta. Don haka ki yi amfani da ruwan da aka tace, ko ruwan da aka tafasa aka sanyaya a rufe.

24
00:04:32.219 --> 00:04:44.902
Ki wanke ganguna da muciyoyi, ki kurkura, ki goge da alcohol 70%, ki bar su su bushe. Kada ki taɓa amfani da su don abinci.

25
00:04:45.902 --> 00:05:05.209
Preservative, wato maganin hana lalacewa, yana hana ƙwayoyin cuta da ke shigowa daga baya. Hauwa ta tabbata pH ɗinta yana cikin iyakar mai sayarwa, sannan ta auna giram 200 a ma'aunin dijital.

26
00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:16.720
Ki zuba shi ƙasa da kusan digiri 40 na Celsius, saboda zafi yana iya lalata wasu preservative. Kuma ki guji formalin: guba ne.

27
00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:24.315
Yanzu ki zuba a sababbin kwalabe ko waɗanda aka tsabtace, sannan ki rufe ki liƙa rubutu da sauri.

28
00:05:25.315 --> 00:05:32.409
Ki ajiye kwalabe biyu daga kowane haɗi, ɗaya a yanayin ɗaki, ɗaya a wuri mai ɗumi.

29
00:05:32.881 --> 00:05:40.062
Ki duba su kowane mako na mako huɗu, sannan kowane wata: ƙamshi, launi, haske, kauri, pH da kumburi.

30
00:05:41.062 --> 00:06:00.239
Ki karanta Safety Data Sheet, wato takardar bayanin tsaro, ta kowane sinadari. Ki saka safar hannu ta nitrile da gilashin kariya, ki bar iska ta shiga, ki ajiye kwalbar ruwa mai tsabta ta wanke ido a kusa, kamar wannan.

31
00:06:01.239 --> 00:06:10.863
Yanzu ki bi darussan da ke ƙasa. Ki shirya rajistar kayan aikinki, ki gwada pH na kaya biyar a gida, ki kuma shirya kusurwarki mai tsabta.

